Output docs/assets/demo-setup.gif
Output docs/assets/demo-setup.mp4

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 900
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.9

Hide
Type "pnpm demo:setup -- --recording"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 4s
Hide
Type "s"
Sleep 600ms
Show
Sleep 3s
Hide
Type "s"
Sleep 600ms
Show
Sleep 4s
Type "q"
